    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Your flight is under the command of an experienced Captain and crew.\nThey have been thoroughly trained in every emergency procedure.\nPlease follow their instructions should an emergency arise. For. your\nadded safety and comfort we urge you to note the locations of the\nexits and safety equipment indicated on this chart.\nEmergency Information\nQUICK EXIT LOCATIONS CONVAIR\nFORE\nCABIN DOOR\nAUXILIARY EXIT\nWINDOW EXITS\nWINDOW EXITS\nWINDOW EXIT\nCABIN DOOR\nSLIDE\nAFT\nSEE OTHER SIDE FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION\nBRANIFF INTERNATIONAL",
      "SMOKING AND SEAT BELTS\nSeat belts must be fastened when\nthe seat belt sign is on. You may\nwalk about the cabin freely when\nthe sign is off; however, you will\nnotice most experienced air trav-\nelers keep their belts loosely fas-\ntened whenever they are seated\nWe recommend this practice.\nYou may smoke cigarettes any-\nwhere within the cabin except\nwhen the Captain turns on the\n\"No Smoking\" sign.\nWINDOW EXIT OPERATION\n(EXIT?\n(EXIT.)\nREMOVE PLASTIC COVER\nPULL INWARD ON WINDOW\nLIFT WINDOW INTO CABIN\nDOOR OPERATION\nEVACUATION\nSLIDES\nROTATE HANDLE TO\n\"OPEN\" POSITION.\nPUSH DOOR.\nSLIDES ARE PROVIDED NEAR DOOR EXITS\nPLEASE SEE OTHER SIDE\nBRACING POSITIONS\nFORWARD-FACING SEAT\nAFT-FACING SEAT\nPLEASE DO NOT REMOVE CARD FROM PLANE\n0A2AA072\n177"
    ],
